  "starterCode": "import math\ndef solve(x,y,W1,b1,W2,b2,lr=0.01):\n    pass",
  "solution": "### 💡 Intuition & Approach\nVectorized, mathematically sound implementation.\n\n### ⚡ Implementation\n```python\nimport math\ndef solve(x,y,W1,b1,W2,b2,lr=0.01):\n    sig=lambda z:1/(1+math.exp(-max(-60,min(60,z))))\n    z=[b1[j]+sum(x[i]*W1[i][j] for i in range(len(x))) for j in range(len(b1))]\n    a=[sig(v) for v in z]; p=sig(b2[0]+sum(a[j]*W2[j][0] for j in range(len(a))))\n    d2=p-y; d1=[d2*W2[j][0]*a[j]*(1-a[j]) for j in range(len(a))]\n    W2n=[[W2[j][0]-lr*d2*a[j]] for j in range(len(a))]\n    b2n=[b2[0]-lr*d2]\n    W1n=[[W1[i][j]-lr*d1[j]*x[i] for j in range(len(a))] for i in range(len(x))]\n    b1n=[b1[j]-lr*d1[j] for j in range(len(a))]\n    return W1n,b1n,W2n,b2n\n```\n\n### ⏱️ Complexity Analysis\n- **Time Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$\n- **Space Complexity**: $\\mathcal{O}(N)$",
